  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Lesotho in TIP Prevention and Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to a strengthened response to trafficking in persons (TiP) in Lesotho with a focus on victim-centered investigation, prosecution of TiP cases and protection of victims of trafficking. The project is designed to meet a number of programming priorities namely, to systematize victim-centered investigations and protections of TiP cases by the government; to create results-driven community, sub-national, national and regional networks empowered to combat human trafficking; and to raise awareness and provide educational information on human trafficking issues and risk factors to a target population.</narrative>
  </description>
